ot;'-b36f0db0ff42972eEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-766ee37860a8092bEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_JewelsSellerBook</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_JewelsSellerBook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_JewelsSellerBook\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a8043f0e-f39a-4979-b1c7-b0ceb0b490ea</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a8043f0e-f39a-4979-b1c7-b0ceb0b490ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a8043f0e-f39a-4979-b1c7-b0ceb0b490ea\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/The_Glitter_Gala\" title=\"The Glitter Gala\">The Glitter Gala</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-168&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-59</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This extensive primer guides shop owners on how to best display their various products. The pages related to jewellery are earmarked for easy referral.]\n</p><p><br>\nMaxim 1: Space out your wares appropriately. Leave no less than the width of a hand between pieces so as not to crowd the eye.\n</p><p><br>\nMaxim 2: Use light to your advantage. Place gemstones where light shines brightest. The shinier the jewel, the more luxurious it looks.\n</p><p><br>\nMaxim 3: Group complementary items together. If customers are interested in a ruby ring, they will be tempted by the ruby amulet you display next to it.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203103\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25893/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7229/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931277/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.586      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.586      1 -total\n 51.05%   21.231      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.64%   18.978     15 Template:Trim\n 25.31%   10.524      2 Template:Uid\n 16.61%    6.909      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.09%    5.858      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.44%    4.340      1 Template:Books\n 10.03%    4.170      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.79%    4.071      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31705-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203103 and revision id 344366. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}